hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1483","It is narrated by Salam bin Junada, narrated by Waki’, on the authority of Al-Masudi, on the authority of Ali bin Al-Aqmar, on the authority of Abu Al-Ahwas, on the authority of Abdullah, who said: “I have “You have seen us, and no one stays away from it except a hypocrite whose hypocrisy is evident. And you have seen that a man should be guided between two men until he stands in line.”"
